[ti:Cool Cat Can't Comprehend]
[ar:Ash Stu]
[al:The Tragedy of the Gifted Child, Vol. 2]
[re:aligned with Demucs vocal separation + MMS forced alignment; edit timestamps by hand if a line is off]
[00:00.32]Greetings, I am Jesus.
[00:03.36]And Jesus Says:
[00:04.82]Step back
[00:07.01]You weakling mortal
[00:09.67]You mini morsel
[00:12.69]You should know that I'm too cool
[00:15.19]To hang with you
[00:17.72]I'm like The Pixies and Nirvana
[00:20.82]Moonshine and marijuana
[00:23.02]and Joan Baez and Bob Dylan
[00:25.40]Rolled in one
[00:27.97]I got this grandiose delusion
[00:30.95]That's spread around my human
[00:33.41]I think that I do not need
[00:35.39]Your earthling food
[00:38.56]So why then is my inner speech so grim?
[00:48.67]That ask, this cool cat can't comprehend
[00:55.87]Oh why is my inner speech so grim?
[01:04.98]I'll walk to where I'm going
[01:07.32]I'm cooler than your engine
[01:09.69]I do not need foreign parts to cruise my town
[01:14.53]I'm happy and I'm homeless
[01:16.73]I'm tortured troubadouring
[01:18.77]I sure love to sleep on someone else's ground
[01:23.54]So why then is my appetite so thin?
[01:32.83]This ask, this cool cat can't comprehend
[01:39.37]Why is my appetite so thin?
[01:49.10]Step back
[01:51.10]You wretched sinner
[01:53.13]You bad beginner
[01:55.09]You should know that I'm too high
[01:57.49]To hang with you
[01:59.71]I'm like The Beach Boys and The Beatles
[02:02.05]Niquil and funny needles
[02:03.80]and Peter, and Paul, and Mary
[02:05.76]Rolled in one
[02:07.84]I got this grandiose delusion
[02:10.22]That's spread around my human
[02:12.16]I think that I do not need
[02:13.91]Your earthling food
[02:16.21]Back up
[02:18.27]Wise up
[02:20.77]I shall not be your friend
[02:24.37]I'm not joking
[02:28.32]I do not fraternize with mortal men
[02:32.68]So why then is my mirror self so thin?
[02:40.83]This ask, this cool cat can't comprehend
[02:46.80]Why is my mirror self so thin?
